                  "fill": "$ink-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 585,
                  "content": "测验魔石碑上面闪亮着五个刺眼的大字。少年面无表情，唇角却带着一抹自嘲。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.95,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-editor",
                  "fontSize": 18,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "MQe0l",
                  "x": 70,
                  "y": 245,
                  "name": "Paragraph Two",
                  "fill": "$ink-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 585,
                  "content": "紧握的手掌，因为大力而导致略微尖锐的指甲深深刺进掌心，带来一阵钻心的疼痛。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.95,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-editor",
                  "fontSize": 18,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
