                  "fill": "$ink-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 585,
                  "content": "斗之力，三段！级别：低级！测验魔石碑之旁，一位中年男子语气漠然地公布了结果。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.95,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-editor",
                  "fontSize": 18,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
